1
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,407
Wir müssen sofort zurück zur Brücke.

2
00:00:12,136 --> 00:00:14,688
I told you this would happen, didn't I?

3
00:00:18,873 --> 00:00:21,598
Hör auf damit, das bringt doch nichts.

4
00:00:26,668 --> 00:00:29,255
The ship is losing power on every deck.

5
00:00:31,957 --> 00:00:34,341
Ich weiß nicht, ob wir das schaffen.

6
00:00:39,871 --> 00:00:42,775
Listen to me. We only get one chance.

7
00:00:43,770 --> 00:00:45,825
Wo bist du die ganze Nacht gewesen?

8
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:50,513
That is none of your business.

9
00:00:51,784 --> 00:00:54,966
Der Plan war von Anfang an zum Scheitern verurteilt.

10
00:00:56,074 --> 00:00:59,017
Maybe, but it was the only plan we had.

11
00:01:04,744 --> 00:01:07,518
Bleib hier und warte auf mein Zeichen.

12
00:01:11,319 --> 00:01:13,586
Three minutes. That's all I need.

13
00:01:39,644 --> 00:01:41,818
Das Wetter wird morgen deutlich besser.

14
00:01:42,861 --> 00:01:45,856
Nobody comes back from the northern mountains.

15
00:01:48,162 --> 00:01:51,420
Kannst du mir bitte helfen, die Kisten zu tragen?

16
00:01:55,032 --> 00:01:57,486
Of course. Where do you want them?

17
00:02:01,199 --> 00:02:03,842
Ganz hinten, neben dem alten Schrank.

18
00:02:05,178 --> 00:02:07,965
Do you hear that? Something is moving.

19
00:02:10,701 --> 00:02:12,816
Das ist nur der Wind, beruhige dich.

20
00:02:17,319 --> 00:02:20,157
I have a really bad feeling about this place.

21
00:02:24,176 --> 00:02:26,841
Morgen fahren wir in die Stadt und kaufen ein.

22
00:02:31,179 --> 00:02:33,416
Promise me you will be careful out there.

23
00:02:38,258 --> 00:02:39,566
Ich verspreche es dir.

24
00:02:43,411 --> 00:02:46,167
Good. Then let's go before it gets dark.

25
00:03:13,847 --> 00:03:16,196
Warte, ich habe meine Jacke vergessen.

26
00:03:21,126 --> 00:03:23,205
Hurry up, we are already late.

27
00:03:24,430 --> 00:03:26,629
Wie viele Leute kommen heute Abend?

28
00:03:30,160 --> 00:03:32,795
About twenty, if everyone shows up.

29
00:03:37,389 --> 00:03:39,107
Dann brauchen wir mehr Stühle.

30
00:03:43,073 --> 00:03:45,593
I will ask the neighbours tomorrow morning.

31
00:03:47,007 --> 00:03:49,286
Vergiss nicht, die Tür abzuschließen.

32
00:03:50,944 --> 00:03:53,133
Who left the lights on in the basement?

33
00:03:54,723 --> 00:03:56,635
Das war bestimmt wieder dein Bruder.

34
00:03:59,628 --> 00:04:01,652
He never listens to anyone.

35
00:04:06,428 --> 00:04:08,837
Am Ende wird alles gut, glaub mir.

36
00:04:11,405 --> 00:04:13,564
I really hope you are right about that.

